     aaddtt — Analog Devices ADT7460 temperature, voltage, and fan sensor

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     aaddtt** aatt iiiicc??

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaddtt driver provides support for the Analog Devices ADT7460, Analog
     Devices ADT7465, Analog Devices ADT7475, Analog Devices ADT7476, Analog
     Devices ADT7477, Analog Devices ADM1027, National Semiconductor LM85, Na‐
     tional Semiconductor LM96000, SMSC EMC6D10x, SMSC SCH5017 and SMC SCH5027
     temperature sensors.  The sensor possesses a collection of sensor values
     which are made available through the sysctl(8) interface.

